# GeT-RM reference material, Coriell ID NA15245. GeT-RM consensus
# diplotype: *1/*3A -- phase confirmed by 10x Linked-Read Genomics or trio
# analysis (external phasing data this project's VCF-only input does not
# have access to). Source: Pratt VM et al., "Characterization of Reference
# Materials for TPMT and NUDT15: A GeT-RM Collaborative Project." J Mol
# Diagn 2022;24:1079-1088 (PMID 35850928), Table 1, as reproduced in CDC's
# public-domain data table
# (https://www.cdc.gov/lab-quality/media/pdfs/2024/08/TPMT-and-NUDT15-reference-materials_508C.pdf,
# retrieved 2026-08-17).
#
# Genotype-only note (see docs/VALIDATION.md): both *3-family defining
# positions are heterozygous here -- this project's genes/tpmt.py correctly
# reports this as AMBIGUOUS (cis *1/*3A vs trans *3B/*3C), listing *1/*3A as
# one of the two candidates, since dosage alone cannot resolve it without
# the external phasing GeT-RM used. This is the expected, scientifically
# correct behavior for genotype-only input, not a pipeline error.
#CHROM	POS	ID	REF	ALT	QUAL	FILTER	INFO	FORMAT	SAMPLE1
chr6	18130687	rs1142345	T	C	99	PASS	.	GT	0/1
